{
  "job_B3.4.9_20251003_114751": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6s strang & sta\u00f0olf\u00e6st & f\u00e6str\u00e6d on \u00feinum bebodum. On godum worcum he w\u00e6s arod. N\u00e6s he \u00e6fstig ne ea\u00f0bilge ne hatheort, ne oferfyllo ne lufude he. N\u00e6s he gytsere ne strudere ne ofermod ne ni\u00f0ig ne leasfyrh\u00f0, ne deofulcr\u00e6ftas ne lufode he. Dryhten h\u00e6lend, ic bidde \u00f0e ea\u00f0modre stefne & mildre \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u ne l\u00e6te minne lichoman onforl\u00e6dan \u00fea Ne l\u00e6t hine, dryhten, swa gedrehtne. \u00c6r he w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e gebisgod mid manigfealdum geswincum, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t wyt n\u00e6fdon \u00fea ecan Dryhten h\u00e6lend, he oft w\u00e6s d\u00e6lende \u00e6lmessan on \u00feinum naman, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t me ne hingrede on He sealde \u00feam \u00feyrstendan drican, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t me ne \u00feyrste on \u00feysse worulde. He wreah \u00fea nacodan \u00feearfan, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t me ne cole on \u00feysse worulde. He sealde \u00feam geswenctum mannum reste & are, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t ic ne swunce on \u00feysse langan He w\u00e6s li\u00f0wyrde on \u00fe\u00e6re tide, \u00fee he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t ic n\u00e6fre in ecnesse n\u00e6re mid wordum getyrged. Men \u00fea leofestan, utan ge\u00f0encan hu gl\u00e6dlice & hu wynsumlice & hu f\u00e6gre & hu mildlice heo spryc\u00f0, \u00deonne bryt se lichoma on manigfealdum bleon; \u00e6rest he bi\u00f0 on medmicles mannes hiwe, \u00feonne \u00e6t \u00deonne \u00e6t ny",
